 reference does not match any bundled artifact, such as a file the skill writes at runtime."},{"code":"reference_missing","message":"A local path-like reference does not match any bundled artifact, such as a file the skill writes at runtime."}],"execution":{"acquisition_seconds":0.741928,"analysis_seconds":3.849109,"exit_code":1,"finished_at":"2026-10-31T06:36:42Z","started_at":"2026-10-31T06:36:38Z","state":"completed"},"finding_count":2,"finding_group_count":2,"findings":[{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"\n7. **delete_note requires exact path confirmation.** `confirmPath` must be character-identical to `path`. No normalization, no trailing-slash tolerance. Mismatch silently fails with `success: false`.\n\n8. **move_file needs double confirmation.** Both `confirmOldPath` and `confirmNewPath` must exactly match their counterparts. Use `move_note` for markdown renames (text-aware, no confirmation needed); use `move_file` only for binary files or when you need binary-safe moves.\n\n9. **manage_tags reads from two sources but writes to one.** `list` merges frontmatter tags + inline `#hashtags`. `add`/`remove` only modify the frontmatter `tags` array. Inline tags are never touched.\n","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"no confirmation","finding_ids":["finding-3728aa8a49f94482bebac8a71d27287f"],"id":"sha256:8b2030d5b10b865988232870b3b8e4b476886d6ad52df72064aa04cacc40e1a0","intent":null,"line":64,"match_fingerprint":"8d917baac03779a421e90f894620a765c8fd0787d50e2d8abf3d4267050d15a4","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-3728aa8a49f94482bebac8a71d27287f","line":64,"path":"SKILL.md","start_column":176}],"path":"SKILL.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":176,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]},{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"\n## move_note\n\nText-aware move for markdown files. Reads source as UTF-8, writes to destination with `wx` flag (fails if target exists unless `overwrite: true`), then deletes source. No confirmation parameters needed. It does not rewrite wikilinks in other notes; follow the Safe Note Rename Workflow in SKILL.md to discover, repair, and verify backlinks explicitly.\n\n**Response:** `{ \"success\": bool, \"oldPath\": str, \"newPath\": str, \"message\": str }`\n","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"No confirmation","finding_ids":["finding-f0891bd7144a4d7796a9401dce54fcd1"],"id":"sha256:cafafea4227bcd09db74b49a1fd094b49998d32d733dad28f32b126b900d4a55","intent":null,"line":58,"match_fingerprint":"afca04afeb75db76cbddc1ffb2a73598f31d2d03b5941c69a9de6af31da2733a","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-f0891bd7144a4d7796a9401dce54fcd1","line":58,"path":"resources/tool-patterns.md","start_column":168}],"path":"resources/tool-patterns.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":168,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]}],"findings_truncated":false,"freshness":"current","id":"bitbonsai/mcpvault/obsidian","kind":"standalone_skill","plugin_path":null,"profile":{"digest":"sha256:a73e7c4a9fa0ac563a885c541d2